{
  "name": "@agentgate-builder/counterpartycheck",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "mcpName": "co.youraitools/counterpartycheck",
  "description": "Pre-payment counterparty check for AI agents and MCP: before paying, approving or interacting with an EVM (Base, Ethereum, Polygon, Arbitrum One) or Solana address, get ok / caution / block with reasons from OFAC SDN and ScamSniffer screening, the x402 Bazaar payee directory, wallet vs contract vs token vs Safe, verification, ENS / Basename and cross-chain presence. Free MCP server; full reports via x402 pay-per-call API.",
